<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan forex reserves up at $1.829 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan forex reserves up at $1.829 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's foreign exchange reserves rose to $1.829 billion on June 28 from $1.705 billion a week earlier, but lower than $2.528 billion on June 27, 1996, the State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    (MLN DLRS)		JUNE 28    JUNE 21    JUNE 27, 1996</p>
<p>TOTAL			   1,829	1,705	2,528</p>
<p>Forex in Pakistan	     525	  759	  690</p>
<p>Forex outside Pakistan	631	  273	1,146</p>
<p>Gold coins and bullion	672	  672	  691</p>
<p>Special Drawing Rights	  1	    1	    1</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
